Package: qfracturepexa
Title: QFracture-2012 Fracture Risk - ModelsCloud Service
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ramin", "Rezaeianzadeh", email = "raminrzn@student.ubc.ca",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("ClinRisk Ltd", role = c("cph", "ctb"),
           comment = "QFracture-2012 equations and C code (LGPL-3)"))
Description: Risk of major osteoporotic fracture (hip, wrist, shoulder or
    spine) and of hip fracture over 1 to 18 years, from the QFracture-2012
    equations (Hippisley-Cox and Coupland, BMJ 2012 <doi:10.1136/bmj.e3427>).
    The equations are translated from ClinRisk's QFracture-2012 C code and
    checked against the compiled C code. ClinRisk's disclaimer is returned
    with every score.
